OL,4,BMotorcycle rider who took stunning     
OL,5,Bcricket catch found                    
OL,6,G"I told my friend riding the           
OL,7,Gmotorcycle to duck his head. I'm going 
OL,8,Gto catch it."                          
OL,10,FThese are the words of Mehran Khan,    
OL,11,Fwho amazed sports fans around the      
OL,12,Fworld when he caught a cricket ball    
OL,13,Fwhile sitting on the back of a moving  
OL,14,Fmotorcycle.                            
OL,16,FMehran was passing a match in the Swat 
OL,17,FPremier League in Mingora when a ball  
OL,18,Fsailed out of the ground towards him,  
OL,19,Fwith the passenger reaching out to     
OL,20,Fcatch it one-handed.                   
